00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:33.464
into thinking that it's fasting
so you get the benefits,

00:02:33.464 --> 00:02:36.140
the physiological benefits of fasting

00:02:36.978 --> 00:02:40.380
without going on completely nothing.

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:44.280
But for me, for a big man like me--

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:45.640
- What happened?
- I'm just adding to

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:47.263
the big man montage.

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:53.530
700 calories is not a lot
so I lost nine pounds,

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:57.483
