you're as big as I am,

00:02:58.493 --> 00:03:01.360
but I actually had the benefit of--

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.130
- How much did you weigh?

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:06.640
- I was probably like 215 when I started.

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:07.507
- Okay.

00:03:07.507 --> 00:03:10.536
