there and you hold the thing

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:20.703
and it gives a very
specific analysis of your,

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:23.440
I trust that it's accurate.

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:24.420
- There's one at my gym too.

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:26.931
You stand on the thing barefoot

00:03:26.931 --> 00:03:29.170
and then you hold these
things on your thumbs

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:30.213
and you hold your arms out like that.

00:03:30.213 --> 00:03:32.150
- Yeah.
- And you don't move.

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:34.210
