00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:34.190
She'll go to the middle
of the road and like--

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:35.470
- Yeah she wants people to know.

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:38.220
- I wanna have a wide berth as I--

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:39.053
- That's funny 'cause Barbara--

00:09:39.053 --> 00:09:40.227
