- And I always thought

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:44.860
that that was, I was
doing something wrong.

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:48.970
Like she's stupid, she doesn't understand.

00:09:48.970 --> 00:09:50.960
We never told her that
she shouldn't do that.

