00:22:33.900 --> 00:22:35.920
That's what's happening, then
we walked around the corner.

00:22:35.920 --> 00:22:37.730
- Well who the hell is Dr. Noodle?

00:22:37.730 --> 00:22:41.010
- Well, I don't know, he's that guy.

00:22:41.010 --> 00:22:42.860
But here's the thing,
he had this amazing look

00:22:42.860 --> 00:22:47.820
