and guess what we saw?

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:47.150
We saw the other car
from that vantage point,

00:23:47.150 --> 00:23:50.500
it said Mr. Noodle, we
were like, look, Lily.

00:23:50.500 --> 00:23:51.810
