00:25:08.810 --> 00:25:09.660
- It was like an Accord.

00:25:09.660 --> 00:25:11.833
- Yeah, he's going to the Accord car show.

00:25:13.750 --> 00:25:16.150
- So anyway, he recognized
me and I will say

00:25:17.488 --> 00:25:19.565
