that I am with someone.

00:28:58.190 --> 00:29:01.390
Might be my family, it might be friends,

00:29:01.390 --> 00:29:05.033
and getting recognized
when I'm with someone,

00:29:06.570 --> 00:29:09.250
it gives you just a
little, I got recognized.

00:29:09.250 --> 00:29:11.240
You know what I'm saying?
- Yeah.

00:29:11.240 --> 00:29:16.240
- It's sort of the self-centered
egotistical part of me

00:29:16.850 --> 00:29:19.590
responds to the fact that hey,

00:29:19.590 --> 00:29:22.163
I was in a group of people
and I got recognized.

00:29:23.130 --> 00:29:26.180
And then when you're with your family--

00:29:26.180 --> 00:29:28.100
- Someone that you care
about their opinion of you.

00:29:28.100 --> 00:29:31.930
- Right and then if I'm
with my mom gets such a kick

00:29:31.930 --> 00:29:33.000
