know Rhett and Link?"

00:29:42.810 --> 00:29:44.882
Just so that she can be
like, "Well Rhett's my son."

00:29:44.882 --> 00:29:46.238
(laughs)

00:29:46.238 --> 00:29:47.540
- Right.

00:29:47.540 --> 00:29:51.623
- So if I'm out in public
and then we get recognized,

00:29:51.623 --> 00:29:54.740
she gets a kick out of that so
I kinda get a kick out of it.

00:29:54.740 --> 00:29:58.065
Well, my brother and his
boys recently came out

00:29:58.065 --> 00:30:02.260
