if you live on the east side is when

00:30:06.980 --> 00:30:08.260
you've got family in town.

00:30:08.260 --> 00:30:11.780
You don't ever go over
there on your own volition.

00:30:11.780 --> 00:30:13.958
It's just like oh we got people in town,

00:30:13.958 --> 00:30:16.960
let's show 'em Los
Angeles that we never see.

00:30:16.960 --> 00:30:18.800
So we went to--
- You talkin' Santa Monica?

00:30:18.800 --> 00:30:19.920
- We went to Santa Monica.

00:30:19.920 --> 00:30:21.380
- You talkin' Venice Beach?

00:30:21.380 --> 00:30:22.213
- We didn't do Venice Beach.

00:30:22.213 --> 00:30:24.160
We have done Venice Beach
with them, but you know,

00:30:24.160 --> 00:30:26.440
you need that like once every five years.

00:30:26.440 --> 00:30:28.940
So we were at Third Street Promenade,

00:30:28.940 --> 00:30:31.710
