situation down there.

00:30:31.710 --> 00:30:35.160
We go into the Urban
Outfitters because you know,

00:30:35.160 --> 00:30:36.552
it's different over there. (chuckles)

00:30:36.552 --> 00:30:37.390
- I guess.

00:30:37.390 --> 00:30:40.387
