different, it's the west side.

00:30:40.387 --> 00:30:43.330
No so we're going through
and then all of a sudden

00:30:43.330 --> 00:30:48.330
I realize that there is
a dog just, a bulldog,

00:30:49.000 --> 00:30:50.320
an American bulldog.

00:30:50.320 --> 00:30:51.910
- Are you about to tell
me you got recognized

00:30:51.910 --> 00:30:52.900
