me, they were fans.

01:16:00.960 --> 01:16:03.323
It was a little more
like giddy fan energy.

01:16:04.550 --> 01:16:08.060
So I've learned to deal
with the fact that like

01:16:08.060 --> 01:16:10.270
okay, I know I'm being watched right now

01:16:10.270 --> 01:16:12.116
even though I'm on a date.

01:16:12.116 --> 01:16:13.741
- Yep.
- It's like,

01:16:13.741 --> 01:16:16.150
there was a couple of years
there were it was like

01:16:16.150 --> 01:16:18.960
that did a number on me.

01:16:18.960 --> 01:16:20.453
But I think I'm over that.

01:16:21.620 --> 01:16:22.640
But--

01:16:22.640 --> 01:16:23.750
- I thought this was gonna end with,

01:16:23.750 --> 01:16:25.410
and I went and sat with them.

01:16:25.410 --> 01:16:26.770
- We got a picture afterward.

01:16:26.770 --> 01:16:28.050
