approach me at the table

01:16:32.030 --> 01:16:33.930
so I thought that was a nice boundary.

01:16:35.200 --> 01:16:36.810
But it was weird 'cause you know,

01:16:36.810 --> 01:16:38.702
you ever feel like you're being watched

01:16:38.702 --> 01:16:40.290
